<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Bre-X raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Bre-X raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers said it upgraded Bre-X Minerals Ltd to outperform. Previous rating not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Said Bre-X's share price has fallen to attractive levels.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Although there are still some uncertainties, we believe this stock will be at significantly higher levels a year from now.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Nasdaq-listed shares rose 5/8 to 13-1/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
